  "contentHtml": "<p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b7fc7a803e690488de9e941bdcc999168bc0ce82\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b7fc7a803e690488de9e941bdcc999168bc0ce82\" data-origin-width=\"992\" data-origin-height=\"1403\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/68b58ac90aa4f3be774e46d7e9e9e6e32450a502\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/68b58ac90aa4f3be774e46d7e9e9e6e32450a502\" data-origin-width=\"992\" data-origin-height=\"1403\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8bb399df6803219af89c9ff7c1d84a59a37b3acb\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8bb399df6803219af89c9ff7c1d84a59a37b3acb\" data-origin-width=\"983\" data-origin-height=\"592\"></div><p>이런 식으로 파일마다 단원별 수행평가지와 평가기준, 점수표가 들어있습니다.</p><p>저희 아이들이... 잘 못해서... 문항이 변별력 없고 너무 쉽게 느껴지실 수 있어요...</p><p>&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">1단원 물질의 구성 수행평가</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3b5f86e22ca1b8bf738817b775d15e3a7919adee?download\" data-file-name=\"수행평가 1. 원소 설명 포스터 제작 및 발표 (5인 팀과제).hwp\" data-file-size=\"60416\" data-mimetype=\"application/vnd.hancom.hwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHp%26dataid%3D924%26fileid%3D16%26regdt%3D20220218220144&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F3b5f86e22ca1b8bf738817b775d15e3a7919adee')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">수행평가 1. 원소 설명 포스터 제작 및 발표 (5인 팀과제)</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">59.00KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/90d5714f9b5036045e69569f86b67953eeb64184\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/90d5714f9b5036045e69569f86b67953eeb64184\" data-origin-width=\"1076\" data-origin-height=\"1046\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e6608d854327de02a784359046760767694642f5\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e6608d854327de02a784359046760767694642f5\" data-origin-width=\"1076\" data-origin-height=\"535\"></div><p>이런 식으로 포스터 제작해서 발표하는 프로젝트 활동입니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">2단원 전기와 자기</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c1c6683f6e58b76a5c9139a0d007321a1621073f?download\" data-file-name=\"수행평가 2. 전류, 전압, 저항의 관계 실험.hwp\" data-file-size=\"751616\" data-mimetype=\"application/vnd.hancom.hwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHp%26dataid%3D924%26fileid%3D15%26regdt%3D20220218220144&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fc1c6683f6e58b76a5c9139a0d007321a1621073f')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">수행평가 2. 전류, 전압, 저항의 관계 실험</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">734.00KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/95080df4a73f4906439e17fee68ed5fd37b3fb6a?download\" data-file-name=\"수행평가 2. 전류가 흐르는 도선이 받는 힘 실험.hwp\" data-file-size=\"361472\" data-mimetype=\"application/vnd.hancom.hwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHp%26dataid%3D924%26fileid%3D6%26regdt%3D20220218220144&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F95080df4a73f4906439e17fee68ed5fd37b3fb6a')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">수행평가 2. 전류가 흐르는 도선이 받는 힘 실험</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">353.00KB</div></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">3단원 태양계</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/15086436d68e7e41b2c2f207cac194728758bde0?download\" data-file-name=\"수행평가 3. 행성의 특징과 분류 (2020 오픈북).hwp\" data-file-size=\"163840\" data-mimetype=\"application/vnd.hancom.hwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHp%26dataid%3D924%26fileid%3D14%26regdt%3D20220218220144&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F15086436d68e7e41b2c2f207cac194728758bde0')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">수행평가 3. 행성의 특징과 분류 (2020 오픈북)</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">160.00KB</div></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">4단원 식물과 에너지</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0f0985292388551759375feda51c0be1779b5a1d?download\" data-file-name=\"수행평가 4. 기공 관찰 실험 (2021).hwp\" data-file-size=\"212992\" data-mimetype=\"application/vnd.hancom.hwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHp%26dataid%3D924%26fileid%3D7%26regdt%3D20220218220144&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F0f0985292388551759375feda51c0be1779b5a1d')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">수행평가 4. 기공 관찰 실험 (2021)</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">208.00KB</div></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">5단원 동물과 에너지</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/43fa00a391a38d39839beb5a13e36e6ecf0f8192?download\" data-file-name=\"수행평가 5. 영양소 검출 서논술 (2019).hwp\" data-file-size=\"32768\" data-mimetype=\"application/vnd.hancom.hwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHp%26dataid%3D924%26fileid%3D8%26regdt%3D20220218220144&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F43fa00a391a38d39839beb5a13e36e6ecf0f8192')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">수행평가 5. 영양소 검출 서논술 (2019)</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">32.00KB</div></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">6단원 물질의 특성</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2088216c043d5d32f597e5e7c165bb777cfc3893?download\" data-file-name=\"수행평가 6. 밀도 측정 실험 (2019 에탄올 알루미늄).hwp\" data-file-size=\"67584\" data-mimetype=\"application/vnd.hancom.hwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHp%26dataid%3D924%26fileid%3D9%26regdt%3D20220218220144&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F2088216c043d5d32f597e5e7c165bb777cfc3893')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">수행평가 6. 밀도 측정 실험 (2019 에탄올 알루미늄)</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">66.00KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2d6e8cfe393b7e81de4eaa60e5c520658ecc4ed1?download\" data-file-name=\"수행평가 6. 밀도 측정 실험 (2020 볼트 너트).hwp\" data-file-size=\"181760\" data-mimetype=\"application/vnd.hancom.hwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHp%26dataid%3D924%26fileid%3D10%26regdt%3D20220218220144&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F2d6e8cfe393b7e81de4eaa60e5c520658ecc4ed1')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">수행평가 6. 밀도 측정 실험 (2020 볼트 너트)</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">177.50KB</div></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">밀도 측정을 두 가지 버전으로 시도했습니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">올해는 에탄올, 알루미늄으로 수업 한 번 하고 실제 수행 때는 볼트, 너트를 쓰려고 합니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/134120e8d5e72e5847be773c2855ff2aa6646ab6?download\" data-file-name=\"수행평가 6. 혼합물의 분리 (2019 4인 팀과제).hwp\" data-file-size=\"300544\" data-mimetype=\"application/vnd.hancom.hwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHp%26dataid%3D924%26fileid%3D11%26regdt%3D20220218220144&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F134120e8d5e72e5847be773c2855ff2aa6646ab6')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">수행평가 6. 혼합물의 분리 (2019 4인 팀과제)</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">293.50KB</div></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">실제 혼합물을 분리 실험하는 프로젝트인데,</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">개별 실험 설계 후 아이들 시험지를 복사해 복사본을 나눠주고 모둠별로 최종 실험 설계하게 했습니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">(개인 점수와 개별 점수 구분을 위해...)</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">실험에 실패한 조는 각자 실패 원인을 분석해서 제대로 적어 제출한 경우 성공과 동일한 점수를 부여했습니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">이 실험 재미있었고 아이들도 좋아했는데... 혼합물 준비하는 게 어렵고... 스티로폼 조각 날리고 폐기물 처리하는 게 힘들어서 잘 안하게 되네요 ㅠㅠ</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">7단원 수권과 해수의 순환</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5847c0e21b9a4be3b9ff7cf8a44b8cb3dae10d0f?download\" data-file-name=\"수행평가 7. 해류와 조석현상 분석 (2020).hwp\" data-file-size=\"180224\" data-mimetype=\"application/vnd.hancom.hwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHp%26dataid%3D924%26fileid%3D13%26regdt%3D20220218220144&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F5847c0e21b9a4be3b9ff7cf8a44b8cb3dae10d0f')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">수행평가 7. 해류와 조석현상 분석 (2020)</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">176.00KB</div></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">8단원 열과 우리 생활</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bdf67c72d160db7b00ae76768c1726e4fad77c3d?download\" data-file-name=\"수행평가 8. 열의 이동 방법 서논술.hwp\" data-file-size=\"248832\" data-mimetype=\"application/vnd.hancom.hwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHp%26dataid%3D924%26fileid%3D12%26regdt%3D20220218220144&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fbdf67c72d160db7b00ae76768c1726e4fad77c3d')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">수행평가 8. 열의 이동 방법 서논술</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">243.00KB</div></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
